he government will be held accountable.]", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63210.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761360, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "LZpWo68o1h", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761357, "segment_id": "zoF5orDY22", "segment_broadcast_id": "LZpWo68o1h", "segment_title": "New York, New York / Statue of Liberty", "segment_description": "(Studio: John Roberts) The reopening of the Statue of Liberty in New York City for the first time since the September 11 attacks noted; scenes shown.", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63340.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761361, "network_name": "CBS", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "LZpWo68o1h", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-03", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 2, "distributor": 9, "broadcast_title": "CBS Evening News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761357, "segment_id": "QErmKa9SdE", "segment_broadcast_id": "LZpWo68o1h", "segment_title": "Campaign 04 / Bush vs. Kerry / Health Care", "segment_description": "(Studio: John Roberts) Findings of a study of Americans with employer-provided health insurance cited.   (Beloit, Wisconsin: Jim Axelrod) Senator John Kerry\u2019s address of voters\u2019 concerns about health care featured. [KERRY \u2013 says he has a plan for health care for 